00:32:02,664 --> 00:32:03,664
You're so sweet.

828
00:32:03,664 --> 00:32:05,664
I don't know if I'll do it.

829
00:32:05,664 --> 00:32:07,664
Please do it.

830
00:32:07,664 --> 00:32:08,664
Please do it.

831
00:32:08,664 --> 00:32:15,664
I thought it would make the tour more fun if we had this shout-out or something like that.

832
00:32:15,664 --> 00:32:18,664
So please join us and shout it out!

833
00:32:18,664 --> 00:32:20,664
I've learned how to shout now.

834
00:32:20,664 --> 00:32:23,664
I'd like to ask you to speak up!

835
00:32:23,664 --> 00:32:24,664
Enjoy the tour!

836
00:32:24,664 --> 00:32:26,664
Enjoy the tour and eat lots of delicious food!

837
00:32:26,664 --> 00:32:28,664
I hope you will enjoy the Happy Train Tour

838
00:32:28,664 --> 00:32:32,664
I hope you enjoy the tour with Hinatazaka.

839
00:32:32,664 --> 00:32:33,664
Yes, ma'am.

840
00:32:33,664 --> 00:32:34,664
Now that that's all said and done...

841
00:32:34,664 --> 00:32:36,664
Is there anything left to say?Do you guys have any last words? 

842
00:32:36,664 --> 00:32:38,664
Hmmm...

843
00:32:39,328 --> 00:32:41,328
It's okay.

844
00:32:41,328 --> 00:32:43,328
It's still hot, folks.

845
00:32:43,328 --> 00:32:45,328
Really.

846
00:32:45,328 --> 00:32:47,328
But it's like the sun.

847
00:32:47,328 --> 00:32:49,328
Sometimes it's even hotter than the sun.

848
00:32:49,728 --> 00:32:59,488
Take care, Mr. Chairman, and please get some of the cute goods we've brought out for you,

849
00:32:59,488 --> 00:33:04,808
I'm going to enjoy the Happy Train Tour with you all.

850
00:33:04,808 --> 00:33:09,048
Yes, that's it for today. I'm sorry for the mess.

851
00:33:09,048 --> 00:33:14,328
Yes, really. But I got it out. It was fun to eat a lot of delicious food.

852
00:33:15,328 --> 00:33:19,328
Yes, thank you very much for today.

853
00:33:19,328 --> 00:33:22,328
See you again.

854
00:33:22,328 --> 00:33:24,048
Bye bye.

855
00:33:24,048 --> 00:33:27,048
I'll turn it off.
